    {
      "text": "At Blood Plain he fights Ye Lui Qun Xing in this form, charging left and right with astonishing might. The move has no matching rank eight Immortal Gu, so the hound’s battle strength stays at rank seven. Star fragments surround him, collide, and make him cough blood. Chu Du concedes the bout. Ye Lui Qun Xing does not press the kill. Immortal Wang is the fourth fighter from their side that Ye Lui Qun Xing has defeated.",
